# Prioritize the Sales department.
Sales is the main revenue driver, so it should continue receiving the most support, resources, and attention

# Use Sales as the benchmark for performance.
Compare the methods, habits, and processes used in Sales with those in Marketing and Support to identify what makes Sales stronger.

# Invest in employee coaching and training.
Employees whose revenue is below average should receive training, mentoring, or performance support to raise their output.

